:"Proxy!","creator":{"login":"xiang90","id":4479947,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0Nzk5NDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4479947?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90","html_url":"https://github.com/xiang90","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiang90/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":128,"state":"closed","created_at":"2016-04-27T23:53:02Z","updated_at":"2018-04-26T22:32:40Z","due_on":"2016-12-31T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2017-01-13T21:47:52Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2016-09-12T18:39:12Z","updated_at":"2018-08-28T01:31:54Z","closed_at":"2016-09-14T16:50:26Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"ETCD version: v3.0.8\n\nThere is a bug in the current [RWMutex recipe](https://github.com/coreos/etcd/blob/master/contrib/recipes/rwmutex.go#L69-L70). If two processes try to lock the mutex at the same time, the second one starts spinning indefinitely after the first one unlocks the mutex. \n\nThe problem appears to be in the way the previous key revision is taken from the server. It always returns the previous key which already has been deleted ( the watcher in 'waitonlowest' correctly returns that all the time ).\n\nThe code I have attached demonstrates the problem. Simply compile and run two instances at the same time.\n\n``` golang\npackage main\n\nimport (\n    \"fmt\"\n    \"time\"\n\n    \"github.com/coreos/etcd/clientv3\"\n    \"github.com/coreos/etcd/clientv3/concurrency\"\n    \"github.com/coreos/etcd/contrib/recipes\"\n)\n\nvar etcdEndpoint = \"http://127.0.0.1:2379\"\n\nfunc main() {\n    // etcd\n    etcdClient, err := clientv3.New(clientv3.Config{\n        Endpoints:   []string{etcdEndpoint},\n        DialTimeout: 5 * time.Second,\n    })\n    if err != nil {\n        fmt.Printf(\"Failed to create etcd client:%v\", err)\n        return\n    }\n    defer etcdClient.Close()\n\n    session, err := concurrency.NewSession(etcdClient, concurrency.WithTTL(30))\n    if err != nil {\n        fmt.Printf(\"Failed to create etcd session:%v\", err)\n        return\n    }\n\n    mtx := recipe.NewRWMutex(session, \"lock\")\n    mtx.Lock()\n    fmt.Println(\"Critical section\")\n    time.Sleep(time.Second * 15)\n    mtx.Unlock()\n}\n```\n","closed_by":{"login":"heyitsanthony","id":16294350,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjk0MzUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16294350?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony","html_url":"https://github.com/heyitsanthony","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyitsanthony/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/6408/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/6408/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}